        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/SUA22-C.3-SM9> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "Effective monitoring of social, including economic, and ecological outcomes supports better decision-making. Scientific evidence is often limited, and indigenous and local knowledge is underutilized and undervalued." ;
    ipbes:identifier "C.3" .

