        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/SUA22-D.1-SM9> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "The sustainability of the use of wild species in the future is likely to face challenges due to climate change, increasing demand and technological advances. Addressing and meeting these challenges will require transformative changes." ;
    ipbes:identifier "D.1" .

