    ipbes:hasDescription "(A.1.1) The use of wild species directly contributes to the well-being of billions of people globally on a day-to-day basis and is particularly important to people in vulnerable situations (well established) (see appendix II, see section C, figure SPM.8) {1.5, 3.2.1, 3.3.1, 3.3.4.4.2}. " ;
