	Contrary to the pattern observed in other regions, the literature on fishing rarely mentions lack of data on European small-scale fisheries. Still, lack of data does remain a concern in a number of cases including inaccuracy, large underestimation of parameters, undeclared information, and lack of stock assessment analysis for some fishing systems. Contrary to what is observed in the literature about the small-scale fisheries in other regions, no major cases of illegal, unreported and unregulatedITEM CSL_CITATION {"citationID":"alrl51q4sl","properties":{"formattedCitation":"(Colloca, 2017; Ulman, 2013, 2015b)","plainCitation":"(Colloca, 2017; Ulman, 2013, 2015b)","noteIndex":0},"citationItems":[{"id":31513,"uris":["http://zotero.org/groups/2344805/items/M5PJLNTA"],"itemData":{"id":31513,"type":"article-journal","archive":"Scopus","container-title":"Frontiers in Marine Science","DOI":"10.3389/fmars.2017.00244","issue":"AUG","title":"Recent trends and impacts of fisheries exploitation on Mediterranean stocks and ecosystems","URL":"https://www.scopus.com/inward/record.uri?eid=2-s2.0-85027675133&doi=10.3389%2ffmars.2017.00244&partnerID=40&md5=d320e7202957a85f81aef6ae79c84c95","volume":"4","author":[{"family":"Colloca","given":"F."},{"family":"Scarcella","given":"G."},{"family":"Libralato","given":"S."}],"issued":{"date-parts":[["2017"]]}},"label":"page"},{"id":31779,"uris":["http://zotero.org/groups/2344805/items/RD855D5A"],"itemData":{"id":31779,"type":"article-journal","container-title":"Mediterranean Marine Science","ISSN":"1791-6763","issue":"2","journalAbbreviation":"Mediterranean Marine Science","page":"309-342","title":"From bonito to anchovy: a reconstruction of Turkey’s marine fisheries catches (1950-2010)","volume":"14","author":[{"family":"Ulman","given":"A"},{"family":"Bekisoglu","given":"S"},{"family":"Zengin","given":"MA"},{"family":"Knudsen","given":"S"},{"family":"Unal","given":"VAHDET"},{"family":"Mathews","given":"C"},{"family":"Harper","given":"S"},{