nvres.2017.06.012&partnerID=40&md5=df0c973c61e6ab1d0fca79b1ac12e058","volume":"129","author":[{"family":"Szostek","given":"C.L."},{"family":"Murray","given":"L.G."},{"family":"Bell","given":"E."},{"family":"Kaiser","given":"M.J."}],"issued":{"date-parts":[["2017"]]}},"label":"page"}],"schema":"https://github.com/citation-style-language/schema/raw/master/csl-citation.json"}.
