ar","given":"O.A."},{"family":"Pieroni","given":"A."},{"family":"Pironon","given":"S."},{"family":"Prescott","given":"T.A.K."},{"family":"Qi","given":"Y.D."},{"family":"Qin","given":"H."},{"family":"Quave","given":"C.L."},{"family":"Rajaovelona","given":"L."},{"family":"Razanajatovo","given":"H."},{"family":"Reich","given":"P.B."},{"family":"Rianawati","given":"E."},{"family":"Rich","given":"T.C.G."},{"family":"Richards","given":"S.L."},{"family":"Rivers","given":"M.C."},{"family":"Ross","given":"A."},{"family":"Rumsey","given":"F."},{"family":"Ryan","given":"M."},{"family":"Ryan","given":"P."},{"family":"Sagala","given":"S."},{"family":"Sanchez","given":"M.D."},{"family":"Sharrock","given":"S."},{"family":"Shrestha","given":"K.K."},{"family":"Sim","given":"J."},{"family":"Sirakaya","given":"A."},{"family":"Sjöman","given":"H."},{"family":"Smidt","given":"E.C."},{"family":"Smith","given":"D."},{"family":"Smith","given":"P."},{"family":"Smith","given":"S.R."},{"family":"Sofo","given":"A."},{"family":"Spence","given":"N."},{"family":"Stanworth","given":"A."},{"family":"Stara","given":"K."},{"family":"Stevenson","given":"P.C."},{"family":"Stroh","given":"P."},{"family":"Suz","given":"L.M."},{"family":"Tambam","given":"B.B."},{"family":"Tatsis","given":"E.C."},{"family":"Taylor","given":"I."},{"family":"Thiers","given":"B."},{"family":"Thormann","given":"I."},{"family":"Vaglica","given":"V."},{"family":"Vásquez-Londoño","given":"C."},{"family":"Victor","given":"J."},{"family":"Viruel","given":"J."},{"family":"Walker","given":"B.E."},{"family":"Walker","given":"K."},{"family":"Walsh","given":"A."},{"family":"Way","given":"M."},{"family":"Wilbraham","given":"J."},{"family":"Wilkin","given":"P."},{"family":"Wilkinson","given":"T."},{"family":"Williams","given":"C."},{"family":"Winterton","given":"D."},{"family":"Wong","given":"K.M."},{"family":"Woodfield-Pascoe","given":"N."},{"family":"Woodman","given":"J."},{"family":"Wyatt","given":"L."},{"family":"Wynberg","given":"R."},{"family":"Zhang","given":"B.G."}],"accessed":{"date-parts":[["2021",3,29]]},"issued":{"date-parts":[["2020",9]]}}}],"schema":"https://github.com/citation-style-language/schema/raw/master/csl-citation.json"}. What part of the organism is gathered, its phenology, and life form, affects how susceptible the species is to over-harvesting (Table 3.5). Gathering the flowers and fruits of annual-biennial plants shows the greatest susceptibility to overharvesting. Gathering bark and roots also has a high probability of leading to overharvesting.
      
