, Toral, eds. 2018. Assessment of nontimber forest products in the United States under changing conditions. Gen. Tech. Rep. SRS–232. Asheville, NC: U.S. Department of Agriculture, Forest Service, Southern Research Station","language":"en","page":"102-117","source":"www.fs.usda.gov","title":"Social dimensions of nontimber forest products","URL":"https://www.fs.usda.gov/treesearch/pubs/57299","volume":"2018","author":[{"family":"Watson","given":"Kelly"},{"family":"Christian","given":"Colmore S."},{"family":"Emery","given":"Marla R."},{"family":"Hurley","given":"Patrick T."},{"family":"McLain","given":"Rebecca J."},{"family":"Wilmsen","given":"Carl"}],"accessed":{"date-parts":[["2021",3,29]]},"issued":{"date-parts":[["2018"]]}}}],"schema":"https://github.com/citation-style-language/schema/raw/master/csl-citation.json"} 
