      Third, the anthropogenic introduction of invasive alien species is linked with disease emergence in new locations and transmission to new hosts ITEM CSL_CITATION {"citationID":"BmrQwg2I","properties":{"formattedCitation":"(A. Cunningham, 2017; S. F. Walker, 2008)","plainCitation":"(A. Cunningham, 2017; S. F. Walker, 2008)","noteIndex":0},"citationItems":[{"id":440,"uris":["http://zotero.org/groups/2344805/items/J7FGX9LX"],"itemData":{"id":440,"type":"article-journal","container-title":"Australian Forestry","issue":"3","note":"publisher: Taylor & Francis","page":"161–177","title":"Opportunities, barriers and support needs: micro-enterprise and small enterprise development based on non-timber products in eastern Indonesia","URL":"https://doi.org/10.1080/00049158.2017.1329614","volume":"80","author":[{"family":"Cunningham","given":"AB"},{"family":"Ingram","given":"W"},{"family":"Kadati","given":"W"},{"family":"Maduarta","given":"IM"}],"issued":{"date-parts":[["2017"]]}},"label":"page"},{"id":32376,"uris":["http://zotero.org/groups/2344805/items/Y74VQSGD"],"itemData":{"id":32376,"type":"article-journal","container-title":"Current Biology","issue":"18","language":"en","page":"853– 854","title":"Invasive pathogens threaten species recovery programs","volume":"18","author":[{"family":"Walker","given":"S.F."},{"family":"Bosch","given":"J."},{"family":"James","given":"T.Y."},{"family":"Litvintseva","given":"A.P."},{"family":"Valls","given":"J.A.O."},{"family":"Piña","given":"S."},{"family":"Griffiths","given":"R."}],"issued":{"date-parts":[["2008"]]}},"label":"page"}],"schema":"https://github.com/citation-style-language/schema/raw/master/csl-citation.json"}. One of the examples of introductions and escapes of amphibians for international pet trade causing wild species disease is chytridiomycosis that has caused amphibian declines and extinction ITEM CSL_CITATION {"citationID":"pmTvONSq","properties":{"formattedCitation":"(A. A. Cunningham 2015; Beard and O\\\\uc0\\\\u8